{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Snap Quest is a wholesome adventure and exploration game. Return to Star Island and h\u0336\u0313\u0349e\u0334\u034a\u032dl\u0336\u0309\u0358\u0319p\u0335\u0302\u033c your grandmother in re-collecting her missing research.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve various puzzles around the island to capture photographs of creatures and friendly citizens. Record your findings and s\u0337\u0350\u0324a\u0335\u0311\u0319v\u0338\u034c\u033be\u0337\u0309\u0328 your pictures in your very own research journal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rebuild t\u0336\u0344h\u0338\u0346\u0319e\u0335\u031a\u031f i\u0335\u0350\u033as\u0336\u0310\u0333l\u0336\u031b\u0330a\u0338\u0344\u0345n\u0334\u030c\u0353d\u0335\u0309\u0329 by completing scientific studies and collecting research grants. Befriend the small island community and make it prosper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/collectResearchTitle.png?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/research.gif?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your Camera to document your findings! Find and upgrade camera components to uncover lost scientific discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/exploreTitle.png?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/explore.gif?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through diverse environments, day and night, to experience the strange wildlife first hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/questsTitle.png?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/runDowntown.gif?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make friends with the residents and they may assist you in your journey. Perhaps something more may bloom from your relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/glitchTitle.png?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/glitch.gif?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">W\u0338\u0305\u0326\u033ae\u0338\u035b\u033f\u0350\u0318\u032a\u031c\u00a0d\u0335\u0312\u0351\u0312\u0320\u032fo\u0338\u0350\u0312\u0324\u031cn\u0334\u0344\u0307\u0346\u0322'\u0336\u030e\u030f\u034et\u0338\u034a\u0352\u0321\u0359\u0331\u00a0h\u0336\u0346\u0344\u0358\u0333\u032c\u035ca\u0335\u0340\u031f\u0321\u0355v\u0336\u030f\u0315\u0345\u032e\u032ae\u0336\u0344\u031b\u0341\u0328\u0322\u00a0m\u0338\u030e\u034c\u0345\u0333\u0318u\u0337\u0344\u033b\u033a\u0324c\u0334\u035d\u0312\u0350\u0345\u035ch\u0338\u0344\u0359\u0320\u0317\u00a0t\u0338\u0350\u0343\u0312\u0359i\u0336\u0358\u0333m\u0334\u030f\u032c\u032c\u0329e\u0338\u0302\u032b\u0326\u00a0a\u0338\u0301\u0310\u034b\u0320\u033b\u031en\u0337\u0311\u0360\u0323\u0318\u0345d\u0337\u0300\u0351\u030d\u0318\u00a0I\u0335\u034b\u0360\u034e\u031e\u0324\u00a0d\u0335\u0309\u030c\u0339\u0333o\u0336\u0341\u0300\u031dn\u0335\u035b\u0311\u030a\u032d\u0325\u031e'\u0336\u0306\u0340\u034c\u032a\u0318t\u0336\u0352\u034d\u00a0k\u0336\u031a\u0315\u0345\u035cn\u0338\u030c\u0314\u034b\u0349o\u0337\u0313\u0315\u035d\u034dw\u0336\u030d\u0306\u0311\u0347\u0318\u00a0i\u0338\u0344\u0350\u0327\u031df\u0335\u0301\u032e\u00