arch grants. Befriend the small island community and make it prosper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/collectResearchTitle.png?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/research.gif?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your Camera to document your findings! Find and upgrade camera components to uncover lost scientific discoveries!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/exploreTitle.png?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/explore.gif?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through diverse environments, day and night, to experience the strange wildlife first hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/questsTitle.png?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/runDowntown.gif?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make friends with the residents and they may assist you in your journey. Perhaps something more may bloom from your relationships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/glitchTitle.png?t=1748029176\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2327110/extras/glitch.gif?t=174802917